WEBVTT

00:01.760 --> 00:06.560
Maintaining Absolute Law,
which brings happiness to so many...

00:08.440 --> 00:12.010
I once did nothing but envy others
as I waited for death,

00:12.010 --> 00:14.670
and then you showed me the right path to walk.

00:17.410 --> 00:21.710
So, I will win the Joust tomorrow, without fail.

00:22.820 --> 00:27.080
So, that I can teach the world that Neotopia
is the true Absolute Justice.

00:40.640 --> 00:48.240
Far away from the town where I was born

00:48.240 --> 00:51.410
I am singing

00:51.410 --> 00:59.050
Tucking my weak heart and my wavering feelings

00:59.050 --> 01:02.320
Away in my pocket

01:02.320 --> 01:07.860
Toward where I hear someone calling me

01:07.860 --> 01:12.900
Toward the unknown road

01:12.900 --> 01:18.340
I'll walk

01:18.340 --> 01:23.750
I'll move forward

01:23.750 --> 01:28.580
Not for someone else's sake

01:28.580 --> 01:34.060
But just as I am, so that I can take pride

01:34.060 --> 01:39.530
Just as the sun rises at dawn

01:39.530 --> 01:44.770
I pick out a melody with my voice

01:44.770 --> 01:48.790
Ephemerally yet strongly

01:50.440 --> 01:53.970
I live

02:00.750 --> 02:04.240
Episode 27
Warriors

02:05.890 --> 02:07.620
Round One Match One:

02:07.620 --> 02:13.150
Moreno of Ulvarx vs. Zed of Templar!

02:27.410 --> 02:29.040
Begin!

02:36.520 --> 02:38.150
What?

02:42.190 --> 02:46.560
Coordinate correction: 0.7 downward-right.

02:47.660 --> 02:50.900
That's what an Ulvarx shard caster is like?

02:50.900 --> 02:52.530
Rambos!

03:03.680 --> 03:05.650
I'm counting on you, Rambos!

03:08.220 --> 03:10.280
Geranos will be sufficient.

03:19.930 --> 03:23.490
This is an Ulvarx spirit?

03:28.000 --> 03:29.800
She stopped him!

03:30.440 --> 03:32.940
Geranos's element is water.

03:32.940 --> 03:36.340
She's the worst possible type of enemy
for your spirit, Rambos.

03:37.580 --> 03:39.380
Who cares about that stuff?

03:39.380 --> 03:41.350
Go, Rambos!

03:51.160 --> 03:52.560
Power, speed...

03:52.560 --> 03:54.930
Geranos is superior in everything!

04:03.810 --> 04:06.870
Hang in there, Zed.

04:06.870 --> 04:12.110
Oh dear, might Zed lose this one?

04:12.110 --> 04:14.980
The shard champion is waiting in the wings,

04:14.980 --> 04:17.610
so he might as well take it easy!

04:21.290 --> 04:23.760
If I don't get out front, I've got no chance!

04:34.800 --> 04:38.340
The shard caster and spirit
seem to have potential,

04:38.340 --> 04:41.340
but his movements are crude
and there's too much waste in them.

04:41.340 --> 04:44.510
Moreno will win this one.

04:44.510 --> 04:46.410
I wonder about that.

04:47.450 --> 04:49.710
Ginga, what do you mean by that?

04:54.020 --> 04:56.320
It's that girl from before!

04:59.160 --> 05:01.650
She's as cute as ever.

05:09.540 --> 05:12.310
I would never have expected that someone
not born a shard caster

05:12.310 --> 05:15.000
would come far enough to control a spirit.

05:16.540 --> 05:21.420
She appears to be using a man-made device
to draw out the power of the shards.

05:21.420 --> 05:25.190
I suppose that is the reason for her appearance.

05:25.190 --> 05:26.190
Yes, Your Holiness.

05:26.190 --> 05:27.720
From the look of it,

05:27.720 --> 05:31.860
I assume the spirit's power has been
greatly amplified and strengthened.

05:31.860 --> 05:34.030
In my humble opinion,

05:34.030 --> 05:36.930
Ulvarx's technological abilities
should not be underestimated.

05:36.930 --> 05:41.470
We don't know what they may be planning.

05:41.470 --> 05:44.100
We must be on the lookout.

06:00.020 --> 06:03.860
Your friend is in trouble.

06:05.390 --> 06:09.260
Is it hard on you, to see your friend lose?

06:10.160 --> 06:14.260
You don't know the first thing about Zed.

06:19.240 --> 06:23.340
My spirit shard is so beautiful.

06:24.480 --> 06:28.250
This pattern... This shine...

06:28.250 --> 06:30.050
It's supreme!

06:33.490 --> 06:38.290
Umm, hadn't you better watch the fight, sir?

06:39.060 --> 06:41.030
Are you stupid?

06:41.030 --> 06:45.130
There's no point in watching
small fry fight each other.

06:45.130 --> 06:47.660
As long as I win, that's what matters.

06:48.540 --> 06:51.530
Who cares about the other guy?

06:53.370 --> 06:57.140
Have I said something to displease you,
Lady Elmeida?

06:57.950 --> 07:00.580
You're the small fry here.

07:00.580 --> 07:02.210
What?!

07:05.020 --> 07:08.290
Damn it, she's got some nerve.

07:08.290 --> 07:12.730
Just you wait, I'll show you which
one of us is stronger,

07:12.730 --> 07:14.520
right here at this Joust.

07:17.300 --> 07:19.970
Pull yourself together, boy.

07:19.970 --> 07:26.030
I want a chance to check out the skills
of the one who defeated Glaudio.

07:28.910 --> 07:31.050
You seem to be completely exhausted.

07:31.050 --> 07:33.750
Well then, I will settle this match.

07:33.750 --> 07:35.380
Keritex!

07:38.750 --> 07:40.380
Rambos!

07:57.970 --> 08:00.570
You can get back on your feet a hundred times,
but it's useless.

08:01.180 --> 08:06.140
Oh my, does Zed really mean to lose?

08:08.650 --> 08:10.670
Damn it!

08:20.500 --> 08:22.120
What?!

08:27.400 --> 08:30.270
This fight isn’t over yet!

08:31.610 --> 08:33.230
How...

08:34.640 --> 08:36.310
Panopria!

08:36.310 --> 08:39.210
How can he be so strong?

08:47.050 --> 08:48.850
A third one?

08:50.420 --> 08:52.790
He's still fighting back.

09:00.540 --> 09:02.160
Zed...

09:02.600 --> 09:05.270
Thank you for your patience, everyone.

09:06.170 --> 09:09.940
Your battle is about to begin at last.

09:09.940 --> 09:14.250
I want each of you to stay calm,
and show us the fruits of your daily training.

09:14.250 --> 09:15.880
Yes, ma'am.

09:16.380 --> 09:17.650
And you, Noah...

09:17.650 --> 09:18.820
Ma'am!

09:18.820 --> 09:21.920
You will be fighting Neotopia's first match.

09:21.920 --> 09:23.790
Please give it your best.

09:23.790 --> 09:25.420
Yes, ma'am.

09:30.030 --> 09:32.500
He seems to be having trouble.

09:32.500 --> 09:34.100
At this rate...

09:34.100 --> 09:36.400
Zed will be the winner.

09:36.400 --> 09:38.670
I'm certain of it.

09:38.670 --> 09:40.610
Noah...

09:40.610 --> 09:42.680
Zed will not lose.

09:42.680 --> 09:45.650
He would never give up so readily.

09:55.060 --> 09:57.590
You surprise me.

09:57.590 --> 10:01.400
From the math, I should have been able
to win with Geranos alone.

10:01.400 --> 10:04.520
But it's over now.

10:05.400 --> 10:07.370
I trust you admit defeat?

10:09.300 --> 10:11.470
Zed will not lose.

10:11.470 --> 10:13.940
He would never give up so readily.

10:20.580 --> 10:22.210
Zed!

10:31.890 --> 10:33.520
Amir Gaul!

11:00.090 --> 11:03.720
Is this the power of a key spirit?

11:13.170 --> 11:14.960
What is this?

11:28.480 --> 11:32.010
The winner: Zed of Templar!

11:44.470 --> 11:46.900
Amir Gaul...

11:58.210 --> 11:59.280
I'm coming in.

11:59.280 --> 12:01.080
Please do!

12:02.650 --> 12:04.390
Zed!

12:04.390 --> 12:07.250
Well, you got through the first round.
Congratulations!

12:07.250 --> 12:08.880
Yeah...

12:09.390 --> 12:11.990
Looks like you're pretty worn out.

12:11.990 --> 12:13.620
Yeah...

12:18.800 --> 12:22.760
Zed, I was certain you would win.

12:23.000 --> 12:27.270
Yeah, like I could lose in the first round!

12:29.980 --> 12:32.410
You're the same as ever.

12:32.410 --> 12:35.220
Your match is next, right?

12:35.220 --> 12:37.550
Don't you lose either, Noah.

12:37.550 --> 12:40.250
Nope, I'll win for sure,

12:40.250 --> 12:42.380
because I want to fight you.

12:43.420 --> 12:45.230
Me?

12:45.230 --> 12:49.320
I've been chasing after you ever
since we were little kids.

12:50.200 --> 12:53.790
I knew I could never catch up, sickly as I was.

12:55.870 --> 12:58.840
But I still chased after you as fast as I could.

13:02.610 --> 13:05.880
I changed after coming to this world.

13:06.650 --> 13:10.740
Now, I can chase after you for real.

13:11.550 --> 13:13.580
Noah...

13:14.560 --> 13:16.690
I want to know.

13:16.690 --> 13:22.890
I want to know how close I've
managed to get to you, Zed.

13:36.740 --> 13:38.750
Noah!

13:38.750 --> 13:41.650
Sagiri! Did you come to see my match?

13:41.650 --> 13:45.610
Yeah! I'm going to cheer for you really, really hard!

13:47.150 --> 13:48.820
I'll count on that.

13:48.820 --> 13:50.790
Oh, Sagiri!

13:51.860 --> 13:53.660
Roya!

13:54.830 --> 13:57.970
You're wearing my good-luck charm!

13:57.970 --> 13:59.600
Of course I am!

13:59.600 --> 14:01.230
See?

14:05.670 --> 14:07.300
Sagiri...

14:07.780 --> 14:11.250
It's about time for you to head back to the stands.

14:11.250 --> 14:13.350
Okay, I will.

14:13.350 --> 14:16.840
Both of you do your best, okay?

14:20.590 --> 14:22.760
That was a surprise.

14:22.760 --> 14:25.520
I didn't know you and Sagiri were acquainted.

14:26.760 --> 14:29.500
We ran into each other in the park yesterday.

14:29.500 --> 14:31.870
She was really friendly with me,

14:31.870 --> 14:34.130
and she even gave me a good-luck charm!

14:34.970 --> 14:36.770
Thank you.

14:38.110 --> 14:40.900
I have something I believe in now,

14:42.280 --> 14:46.110
so I wasn't able to accept that charm from her.

14:49.120 --> 14:51.950
I had someone I wanted to give it to,

14:51.950 --> 14:55.080
but he said he didn't want it.

14:56.660 --> 14:58.450
But I'm so glad...

14:59.160 --> 15:01.900
...that you accepted it.

15:01.900 --> 15:03.930
Oh, but...

15:03.930 --> 15:06.670
I'm truly grateful.

15:06.670 --> 15:08.690
No, you don't have to...

15:09.370 --> 15:11.500
Well, I'll see you again.

15:13.570 --> 15:15.200
Wait...

15:20.580 --> 15:24.780
They should be in the thick of
the matches right now.

15:27.920 --> 15:31.760
So, is Roya weighing on your mind after all?

15:33.360 --> 15:38.890
Roya's been lost ever since
she returned from Tusk.

15:39.870 --> 15:44.810
As we speak, she is being put to the test

15:44.810 --> 15:47.870
about whether she can truly live strongly.

15:49.410 --> 15:52.450
This may sound cold,

15:52.450 --> 15:55.780
but Roya has to overcome this herself.

15:56.950 --> 15:58.780
Very true.

15:59.890 --> 16:02.590
We just have to wait,

16:02.590 --> 16:06.550
and believe that she'll regain her smile
and come back home.

16:07.530 --> 16:09.160
Zico...

16:09.800 --> 16:13.630
When it comes to Roya,
you're nothing but an old grandpa.

16:14.940 --> 16:16.730
Shut up!

16:21.780 --> 16:26.210
Was what you said to Zed earlier true?

16:26.210 --> 16:29.480
That you'd been chasing after him all along?

16:29.480 --> 16:31.540
Well, yes...

16:32.550 --> 16:35.720
When I hear someone else repeat that,
it's a bit embarrassing.

16:37.590 --> 16:40.390
Zed is a strange guy, isn't he?

16:40.390 --> 16:42.830
He's simple, and reckless,

16:42.830 --> 16:46.330
and everything he does is random and crazy.

16:46.330 --> 16:49.530
Are you sure he didn't just cause
you trouble right and left?

16:53.310 --> 16:56.570
I knew it, you're just like me.

16:57.950 --> 17:01.710
But I was jealous of his strength.

17:03.380 --> 17:05.980
You're just like me there too.

17:07.420 --> 17:11.980
I always told myself,
"No way am I going to lose to Zed! "

17:12.630 --> 17:15.820
But now, I'm nowhere near his league.

17:20.870 --> 17:24.400
I wonder how a person can
become strong like that?

17:29.740 --> 17:32.740
Zed was fighting all along.

17:35.420 --> 17:38.150
From back when we were in our world of Calm...

17:38.150 --> 17:39.950
All along.

17:40.520 --> 17:45.390
I can't quite say how, but he was
definitely fighting all that time,

17:45.390 --> 17:48.930
with something that welled up from inside himself.

17:48.930 --> 17:51.450
Searching for the answers with
everything he had.

17:52.070 --> 17:55.800
Searching for the answers with
everything he had?

17:56.940 --> 18:00.430
I imagine that hasn't changed, even now.

18:02.680 --> 18:06.130
That's Zed's strength?

18:09.850 --> 18:12.520
Where in the world did Noah go?

18:12.520 --> 18:14.680
His match is about to start!

18:21.800 --> 18:23.420
That's ...

18:25.000 --> 18:28.470
Noah? And her...

18:28.470 --> 18:30.440
She's from Templar!

18:31.770 --> 18:33.740
What is he doing with her?

18:35.280 --> 18:37.950
I'm going to try my best.

18:37.950 --> 18:41.040
I'll try to fight with all I have
in search of the answers.

18:41.880 --> 18:43.020
Because if I do that,

18:43.020 --> 18:48.420
I might find the answer to how
I should live from now on.

18:49.560 --> 18:52.090
Yeah, I'm sure you will.

18:52.090 --> 18:55.720
I know you can find the answer.

19:03.100 --> 19:06.100
We will now begin Round One Match Two.

19:07.010 --> 19:12.950
Noah of Neotopia vs. Kleinel of Zymot!

19:21.620 --> 19:22.620
Begin!

19:22.620 --> 19:24.250
Gegli!

19:38.170 --> 19:39.800
Sachura!

19:57.060 --> 19:59.690
It's like I can't even touch him.

20:07.130 --> 20:11.330
The winner: Noah of Neotopia!

20:17.410 --> 20:21.850
I can feel the power of that spirit!

20:22.650 --> 20:25.880
Ha, she's pathetic.

20:27.920 --> 20:31.120
Which means that boy will be my prey.

20:33.160 --> 20:35.960
That's our Noah.

20:36.730 --> 20:38.830
You're next, right?

20:38.830 --> 20:40.460
Yeah...

20:42.170 --> 20:44.160
Will you be okay?

20:45.740 --> 20:47.710
I want to find it...

20:50.540 --> 20:52.510
The answer.

20:55.680 --> 21:00.050
So, I'll fight.

21:01.760 --> 21:03.550
I see.

21:10.830 --> 21:14.640
It seems to me such a weak opponent
might have left you a bit unsatisfied.

21:14.640 --> 21:17.070
Not at all.

21:17.070 --> 21:19.110
You're up next.

21:19.110 --> 21:21.340
I'm counting on you to get us another win.

21:21.340 --> 21:23.830
I wonder if that's how you really feel?

21:25.750 --> 21:27.810
Well, it doesn't matter.

21:27.810 --> 21:30.780
After all, I'll be the victor either way.

21:52.770 --> 21:55.610
We will now begin Round One Match Three.

21:56.510 --> 22:02.750
Roya of Templar vs. Kira of Neotopia!

22:17.000 --> 22:19.200
I can't let myself be caught up in the atmosphere.

22:19.200 --> 22:21.500
I have to look at my opponent and nothing else!

22:44.790 --> 22:49.560
Even if we've been far apart

22:49.560 --> 22:53.600
Our hearts are still connected

22:53.600 --> 22:57.170
And always will be, even to the end of time

22:57.170 --> 23:03.510
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:03.510 --> 23:08.380
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

23:08.380 --> 23:09.680
My old days

23:09.680 --> 23:12.050
Living it up on the weekend as always

23:12.050 --> 23:15.890
Just simply having fun, innocently

23:15.890 --> 23:19.760
Grateful days, gone in the blink of an eye

23:19.760 --> 23:22.130
Since then, we've gone our separate ways

23:22.130 --> 23:24.030
Chasing our own goals

23:24.030 --> 23:25.030
We grow up

23:25.030 --> 23:26.700
Tuck our memories in our hearts, and wave

23:26.700 --> 23:27.870
Fix our eyes on where we're going

23:27.870 --> 23:29.870
Neither of us will give up

23:29.870 --> 23:31.510
Knowing the other's fighting just as hard

23:31.510 --> 23:33.610
I don't mind if you're not near me

23:33.610 --> 23:35.580
I want to see your smile, but it's not the time

23:35.580 --> 23:36.580
The more I look back

23:36.580 --> 23:37.580
The more I tell myself I'll show this to you one day

23:37.580 --> 23:39.840
That will never change

23:40.410 --> 23:45.220
Even if we've been far apart

23:45.220 --> 23:49.290
Our hearts are still connected

23:49.290 --> 23:52.890
And always will be, even to the end of time

23:52.890 --> 23:59.230
I want to stay shining forever and ever (stay gold)

23:59.230 --> 24:04.930
I want to stay glittering (stay gold)

24:17.380 --> 24:20.890
Next Time
Proof of Existence

24:17.920 --> 24:20.890


Next time, "Proof of Existence"
